{"unit_id":"alllllinnrann__dsh-inapp-browser#card-zh","repo":"alllllinnrann/dsh-inapp-browser","commit":"d8b355e5c8016e801fda4d49ffbcde85bf56e294","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-inapp-browser 是供 DSH 网页客户端使用的内置共享浏览器插件，在 Better Sidebar 注册浏览器面板，并向 Harness agent 提供一组浏览器工具。人和 agent 可以共用当前聊天的网页会话，打开网址或搜索词、切换标签、前进后退和刷新，也能点击、输入中文、按键、滚动及拖拽。agent 可以读取页面文字和控件位置，或通过截图查看网页画面；面板还支持暂停 AI 浏览器操作。适合需要在 DSH 对话中浏览网页并让 agent 协助操作页面的用户。需要本机安装 Edge、Chrome 或 Chromium；默认搜索和首页使用 Bing。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:34-53","src/index.js:75-120","lib/client.js:201-235","src/platform.js:19-46"]}
{"unit_id":"alllllinnrann__dsh-inapp-browser#card-en","repo":"alllllinnrann/dsh-inapp-browser","commit":"d8b355e5c8016e801fda4d49ffbcde85bf56e294","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-inapp-browser adds a shared browser panel to the DSH web client. Users and agents share a session to open pages, switch tabs, click, type, scroll, and navigate. Agents can read page text and view screenshots. It requires a local Edge, Chrome, or Chromium browser; Bing is the default.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:34-53","src/index.js:75-120","lib/client.js:201-235","src/platform.js:19-46"]}
